= Declaration of AI/LLM usage

Some AI tools were used during this thesis.
The largest usage comes from the use of GitHub Copilot, which was used to assist in writing code for the project at all stages of the project.
It was also used to some extent to improve the formulation of the text in the different documents that I wrote during the project.
Then, Perplexity was used to look for explanation of concepts and to find relevant literature to start with at the beginning of the project.

All methods, results, analyses, and conclusions are my own, and I verified that the content is original and meets academic integrity standards.
